Z||000000||kinboyatuwo||05-18-2001||03:13 PM||||I figure at the rate that i am getting tickets i might as well try!!!!!<P>A police officer pulls Ray over for speeding and has the <BR>following exchange: <P>Officer: "May I see your driver's license?"<P>Ray: "I don't have one. I had it suspended when I got my 5th <BR>DWI."<P>Officer: "May I see the owner's card for this vehicle?"<P>Ray: "It's not my car. I stole it."<P>Officer: "The car is stolen?"<P>Ray: "That's right. But come to think of it, I think I saw the<BR>owner's card in the glove box when I was putting my gun in <BR>there."<P>Officer: "There's a gun in the glove box?"<P>Ray: "Yes, sir. That's where I put it after I shot and killed the<BR>woman who owns this car and stuffed her in the trunk."<P>Officer: "There's a BODY in the TRUNK?!?"<P>Ray: "Yes, sir." <P>Hearing this, the officer immediately called his captain. The <BR>car was quickly surrounded by police, and the captain <BR>approached the driver to handle the tense situation: <P>Captain: "Sir, can I see your license?"<P>Ray: "Sure. Here it is. It was valid."<P>Captain: "Who's car is this?"<P>Ray: "It's mine, officer. Here's the owner' card". Of course I <BR>really owned the car.<P>Captain: "Could you slowly open your glove box so I can see if <BR>there's a gun in it?"<P>Ray: "Yes, sir, but there's no gun in it."  Sure enough, there <BR>was nothing in the glove box. <P>Captain: "Would you mind opening your trunk? I was told you <BR>said there's a body in it."<P>Ray: "No problem. Trunk is opened; no body."<P>Captain: "I don't understand it. The officer who stopped you <BR>said you told him you didn't have a license, stole the car, had <BR>a gun in the glove box, and that there was a dead body in the <BR>trunk."<P>Ray: "Yeah, I'll bet the lying SOB told you I was speeding, <BR>too."<P>------------------<BR>"Friends don't let friends drive four doors."<P>87 Duke, 235,000km||||reg||1
